            "id": "title",
            "text": "Sponsors",
            "level": 1
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "p1",
            "text": "PyPI serves several petabytes a month at no charge to the people who use it. The infrastructure, the content delivery network and the staff who maintain the index are paid for by the Python Software Foundation and by the organisations below."
          },
          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "id": "sp-1",
            "text": "Meridian Cloud",
            "level": 3
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "sp-1-d",
            "text": "Hosts the primary index and the build farm."
          },
          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "id": "sp-2",
            "text": "Harbor CDN",
            "level": 3
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "sp-2-d",
            "text": "Delivers every wheel and source distribution worldwide."
          },
          {
            "kind": "heading",
            "id": "sp-3",
            "text": "Lodestone Security",
            "level": 3
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "sp-3-d",
            "text": "Funds the malware scanning of new uploads."
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "p2",
            "text": "Organisations that would like to sponsor PyPI can read the sponsorship prospectus on the Foundation's site. Individuals can support the Foundation directly."
          }
        ]
      },
