            "text": "Project description",
            "level": 2
          },
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "id": "desc",
            "text": "retrying-simple is a decorator and a function that call something until it succeeds or the attempt budget runs out, waiting between tries by an exponential schedule with optional jitter. The sleep function is a parameter; with clockwork-det, twenty retries take no wall time and happen in a fixed order."
          },
